Kusto Query Language(KQL) query in Azure Log Analytics

STEP 1: Save the Query to a .kql File
STEP 2: Open Azure Portal and Navigate to Log Analytics
        Log Analytics workspaces -->  Logs in the workspace menu
STEP 3: Run the KQL Query
STEP 4: Export the Results
       Export as JSON
       After running the query, click the "Export" button (top right of results pane).
       Select "Export to JSON".
